  "description": "FakeLab is a powerful and versatile library for generating fake data, designed to streamline the development, testing, and prototyping processes. Whether you're building unit tests, seeding databases, or demonstrating application features, FakeLab helps you save time by automating the creation of diverse, customizable datasets. Instead of manually populating a dataset, you can literally generate any number of entities in one line of code.\n\nGeneration of boolean, text, numeric, time, collection and user-defined data types is supported.",
